					"nextDialogs": [
						402461107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402461107,
					"content": "你刚才去哪儿了？哥伦比娅小姐。怎么一转眼就从片场消失，又突然…呃，和这位小姐一起出现。拥抱着。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402461108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 402461108,
					"content": "你…你们刚才…在拍…拍…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402461109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402461109,
					"content": "事情发生得太突然，留影机一直在运转，刚才的画面也拍下了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402461110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "千织"
				},
				{
					"id": 402461110,
					"content": "这位难道就是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402461111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 402461111,
					"content": "嗯，她就是我最好的朋友。没想到真的能和她再次相见。我好高兴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402461112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402461112,
					"content": "看来，这部映影有了个好结局呢。桑多涅。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402461113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402461113,
					"content": "…桑多涅？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402461114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402461114,
					"content": "果然…果然我还是觉得你好烦人啊！！哥·伦·比·娅！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				}
			]
		},
